  "dimensions": [
    {"dimension":"scope","explanation":"The selected duties address Product Providers and their adopted tokenisation arrangements. Register keepers, valuation management companies and intermediaries have distinct actor and activity conditions. Those provisions cannot be transferred wholesale to every Product Provider.","source_unit_ids":["dc689bdf0ffcf.u0.0","dc689bdf0ffcf.u1.224","dc689bdf0ffcf.u7.1802","dc689bdf0ffcf.u9.2169","dc689bdf0ffcf.u10.2702","dc689bdf0ffcf.u11.3045"],"status":"PROPOSED"},
    {"dimension":"definitions","explanation":"Ultimate responsibility, operational soundness, proper records, integrity, satisfactory opinion and high confidence lack complete assessment criteria here. Allocation of responsibility, supervisory conduct and operational outcomes are different propositions; none automatically proves the others.","source_unit_ids":["dc689bdf0ffcf.u0.0","dc689bdf0ffcf.u2.729","dc689bdf0ffcf.u3.944","dc689bdf0ffcf.u4.1185","dc689bdf0ffcf.u6.1694"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},
    {"dimension":"exceptions","explanation":"Outsourcing is expressly ineffective as an escape from responsibility. The applicability qualification in footnote 1 attaches to referenced factors, not to retained responsibility. The SFC request condition qualifies demonstration in paragraph 14 and obtaining assistance in paragraphs 15–16, subject to the footnote 5 ambiguity.","source_unit_ids":["dc689bdf0ffcf.u0.0","dc689bdf0ffcf.u1.224","dc689bdf0ffcf.u3.944","dc689bdf0ffcf.u4.1185","dc689bdf0ffcf.u5.1464","dc689bdf0ffcf.u6.1694"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},
    {"dimension":"modality","explanation":"The circular uses should; register provisions use must, and valuation provisions distinguish shall from should. These excerpts do not establish their legal enforceability or consequences. Paragraph 14's confirmation is unqualified by a request on its ordinary syntax; whether footnote 5 independently requires demonstration remains disputed.","source_unit_ids":["dc689bdf0ffcf.u0.0","dc689bdf0ffcf.u3.944","dc689bdf0ffcf.u4.1185","dc689bdf0ffcf.u7.1802","dc689bdf0ffcf.u9.2169"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},
    {"dimension":"time","explanation":"Remaining responsible and maintaining records indicate continuing responsibilities. Requests activate specified steps without supplied deadlines. Valuation monitoring is ongoing and review periodic; intermediary satisfaction precedes related activities. No effective date, confirmation cadence or assessment period is supplied.","source_unit_ids":["dc689bdf0ffcf.u0.0","dc689bdf0ffcf.u2.729","dc689bdf0ffcf.u3.944","dc689bdf0ffcf.u5.1464","dc689bdf0ffcf.u6.1694","dc689bdf0ffcf.u9.2169","dc689bdf0ffcf.u11.3045"],"status":"PROPOSED"},
    {"dimension":"dependencies","explanation":"Footnote 5 incorporates paragraphs 10–13, whose complete content and mapping are unavailable. Footnote 1 references applicable Appendix Part A factors; the intermediary provisions reference Parts A and B. Footnote 2 is absent. These gaps and missing actual facts prevent a complete fulfillment conclusion.","source_unit_ids":["dc689bdf0ffcf.u1.224","dc689bdf0ffcf.u2.729","dc689bdf0ffcf.u4.1185","dc689bdf0ffcf.u11.3045"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"}
  ],
